old #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust root field contract and attribution[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]root-field[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]root-field: add the \\[root:: NOTE] parser, per-block root facts, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]as-if-residence home resolution, task-metric and theme-default support, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]health lints, shared vectors, and the R11 contract, all additive.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Obsidian root mark[/bold #D7AFFF]                                            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]root-mark[dim] · [dim][/dim]after root-field[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]root-mark: render each root field as a hue-dot place mark in Live [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Preview, Reading view, and Tasks/Dataview rows in bob-ledger-tools, with[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]compact, rolls-up, and repair states, a toggle, tests, docs, and a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugins sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Vault template and ^gtd backfill[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]vault-backfill[dim] · [dim][/dim]after root-field[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault-backfill: add \\[root:: gtd_daily] to the daily template and, per [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the backfill decision, every existing ^gtd line; optionally add theme [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]PLAN to gtd_daily.md; commit under the sync lock and verify.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Retire review buckets in Rust, docs, and memory[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]retire-review[dim] · [dim][/dim]after root-field, vault-back